{
  "title": "1: al-Faatehah الفاتحة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسۡمِ اللهِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِ (1)\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَلۡحَمۡدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الۡعٰلَمِيۡنَۙ‏ (2)\nAL-HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENAR.\nAll praise belongs to Allah, Lord of all the worlds,\nالرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِيۡمِۙ‏ (3)\nRAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nthe All-beneficent, the All-merciful,\nمٰلِكِ يَوۡمِ الدِّيۡنِؕ‏ (4)\nMAALEKE YAUMID DEEN.\nMaster of the Day of Retribution.\nاِيَّاكَ نَعۡبُدُ وَاِيَّاكَ نَسۡتَعِيۡنُؕ‏ (5)\nIYYAAKA NA’BODO WA IYYAAKA NASTA-E’EN.\nYou [alone] do we worship, and to You [alone] do we turn for help.\nاِهۡدِنَا الصِّرَاطَ الۡمُسۡتَقِيۡمَۙ‏ (6)\nEHDENAS SERAATAL MUSTAQEEM.\nGuide us on the straight path,\nصِرَاطَ الَّذِيۡنَ اَنۡعَمۡتَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ ۙ‏ غَيۡرِ الۡمَغۡضُوۡبِ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وَلَا الضَّآلِّيۡنَ‏ (7)\nSERAATAL LAZEENA AN-A’MTA A’LAYHIM, GHAYRIL MAGHZOOBE A’LAYHIM WA LAZ-ZAAALLEEN.\nthe path of those whom You have blessed — such as have not incurred Your wrath, nor are astray.",
  "merits": "Surah al-Fatihah is a cure for physical and also spiritual ailments. Without this Surah, even the daily prayers are incomplete. It is indeed a great treasure that has been given to us by Allah (s.w.t.) through the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) and no previous prophet has been given anything like it. This Surah is also known as ‘Ummul Kitab’ and ‘Sab’a Masaani’."
}
